                    {
                        "form_id": "69a03690-ae1e-4a7c-b028-a243ec9a7241",
                        "entry_id": "f2de8fc7-7f0b-3f4f-829a-41b4d145686e",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "пропаганди́стах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "030e8225-b680-34e0-b939-59e0d4bf539a",
                        "entry_id": "f2de8fc7-7f0b-3f4f-829a-41b4d145686e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "тот, кто занимается пропагандой"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f115190a-462b-45af-80d4-f28baaa748e7",
                                "sense_id": "030e8225-b680-34e0-b939-59e0d4bf539a",
                                "text": "Раньше пропагандист выходил на сцену и говорил что-то толпе, пытаясь повлиять на мнения. Теперь за счёт информационных технологий, возможности сбора и анализа персональных данных стало эффективнее действовать иначе"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cee3f35f-48c4-4722-a419-796dcc7a38b5",
                        "source_entry_id": "f2de8fc7-7f0b-3f4f-829a-41b4d145686e",
                        "source_sense_id": "030e8225-b680-34e0-b939-59e0d4bf539a",
                        "target_lang_word": "propagandist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "propagandist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c03c1c9-e671-3096-bee0-7ca4165bf386",
                                        "entry_id": "9cd2803a-24ce-31b3-96f8-4702dc1a41da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who disseminates propaganda."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b7135ab-368c-4d3f-8ad2-85db4629a013",
                                                "sense_id": "2c03c1c9-e671-3096-bee0-7ca4165bf386",
                                                "text": "Every country has been officially invited by the Belgian Government to send delegates to the International Congress of Agricultural Associations, which will take pace at Brussels in September, 1910. In most countries propagandist committees have been formed in connection with this Congress."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "984b804a-4cb2-47a2-94ac-48778dfe45da",
                                                "sense_id": "2c03c1c9-e671-3096-bee0-7ca4165bf386",
                                                "text": "\"Astroturfers and propagandists tend to attack and controversialize the news organizations, personalities and people surrounding an issue rather than sticking to the facts.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed4935f6-bff0-435d-91ab-aebbfe0afb44",
                                                "sense_id": "2c03c1c9-e671-3096-bee0-7ca4165bf386",
                                                "text": "It's Alexander the Great who everyone remembers and much of that is down to his and his propagandists' genius."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "propagandist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "32f0387e-cc04-3a8e-aada-00ed67164087",
                                        "entry_id": "91a22915-d56a-3fd4-a696-a0f1774409b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Consisting of or spreading propaganda."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6d248fc-085f-4179-b033-5103bbc55e37",
                                                "sense_id": "32f0387e-cc04-3a8e-aada-00ed67164087",
                                                "text": "Of course many of these accounts were propagandist in intention and designed for an unsophisticated audience."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c62681f3-fe35-44e0-9f98-ac1bda8c1ce7",
                                                "sense_id": "32f0387e-cc04-3a8e-aada-00ed67164087",
                                                "text": "In another comment from the audience, one woman raised what is perhaps the anti-pornography movement's strongest point. \"There's a strain of pornography which is incredibly propagandist against women,\" she said."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "52e09189-4445-43e4-989b-c04f95d4a3f1",
                        "source_entry_id": "f2de8fc7-7f0b-3f4f-829a-41b4d145686e",
                        "source_sense_id": "030e8225-b680-34e0-b939-59e0d4bf539a",
                        "target_lang_word": "propagandist",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "propagandist",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "87ce89d1-e585-31c8-9bf5-a8e46376242e",
                                        "entry_id": "317dab1b-6274-332d-88ab-1bcad97b201f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "iemand die aanhangers voor een gedachtegoed probeert te winnen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "258ec5df-7382-4fa3-83d1-dd128cb19687",
                                                "sense_id": "87ce89d1-e585-31c8-9bf5-a8e46376242e",
                                                "text": "De SBU maakte later bekend de journaliste in handen te hebben. „De Russische propagandist Koerbatova wordt onder dwang teruggestuurd naar Rusland”, zei een woordvoerster van de dienst op Facebook."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6304ea3-e3b0-45d4-987a-edcc5cd5b3db",
                                                "sense_id": "87ce89d1-e585-31c8-9bf5-a8e46376242e",
                                                "text": "Een andere lijst vermeldt personen en organisaties die zich 'volksvijandig' opstellen. 'U moet hier denken aan Marxisten, feministen, homoseksualisten, kolonisatie-propagandisten, cultuurafbrekers, et cetera.' Deze lijst wordt bewust apart gehouden van de lijst met Joden. 'Van de Jood, als uitheems organisme, kunnen wij verwachten dat hij zich vijandig opstelt en zich in het openbaar, dan wel in het geniep, inspant voor het verzwakken van het gastvolk.'"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "356660ee-b0f9-4a69-9da5-fa7ba543c1c0",
                        "source_entry_id": "f2de8fc7-7f0b-3f4f-829a-41b4d145686e",
                        "source_sense_id": "030e8225-b680-34e0-b939-59e0d4bf539a",
